Subject: [PATCH] PS5: bound GPU ASTC-to-BC transcode scratch by layer

Adapt the layer batching from PS5_Lichii 8e90019d574daa10eb4a814842a40c2ca1c3a147.
Enable with EDEN_NX2_TRANSCODE_BATCH_LAYERS=1. Preserve the existing CPU fallback and staging refusal path.

diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_texture_cache.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_texture_cache.cpp
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_texture_cache.cpp
